    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "IDYLLIC FOUR-BEDROOM COUNTRY BUNGALOW IN A SOUGHT-AFTER LOCATION JUST OFF THE N3\n\nSmith Property are delighted to present for sale this well-positioned four-bedroom detached bungalow, c.1970`s property occupy`s a private and elevated site in the picturesque countryside townland of Corracarrow, New Inns, Co. Cavan.\n\nSet just off the N3 Cavan - Virginia Road, this property enjoys an exceptionally convenient location, combining the peace and privacy of the countryside with easy access to a number of surrounding towns and amenities. Cavan Town is approximately 16km away, Virginia approximately 12km, Ballyjamesduff approximately 8km, while Dublin is accessible via the N3 in approximately 90km.\n\nThe property occupies a well-defined and private site, with the elevated position providing a pleasant outlook over the surrounding countryside. The front boundary has been enhanced with new country-style fencing and gated access, while the rear of the property features a retaining wall and raised gardens, creating a number of attractive outdoor spaces around the home.\n\nInternally, the accommodation provides four bedrooms together with a sitting room, living/dining area, kitchen and bathroom accommodation. The property benefits from oil-fired central heating and offers a comfortable and functional layout, while also providing considerable scope for modernisation and upgrading to suit the requirements of a new owner.\n\nA particular feature of the property is the detached garage, providing excellent additional storage and practical space. The adjoining field, extending to approximately 1 acre, further enhances the property, offering flexibility and appeal for those seeking additional ground for recreational use, gardening, animals or simply enjoying the space and privacy that a larger rural property can provide.\n\nThe combination of the elevated site, adjoining field, detached garage, established gardens and private countryside setting gives this property a character and flexibility that is increasingly difficult to find.\n\nLocated just off the N3, the property is ideally positioned for those commuting towards Cavan, Virginia, Ballyjamesduff and beyond, while still enjoying the tranquillity of a rural setting. The N3 provides a direct regional connection between Cavan and Virginia, with New Inns positioned along this established route.\n\nThis is a property with plenty of potential and scope, offering prospective purchasers the opportunity to modernise and personalise an existing four-bedroom home while taking advantage of its generous site and additional land.\n\nWhether you are looking for a family home, a countryside property with additional space, or a home that offers scope to create something special over time, this property is well worth consideration.\n\nViewing is highly recommended by appointment through the sole selling agents.\n\n\n"
      },
